{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36207","headline":"书吴道隐林亭 · 方干","name":"书吴道隐林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藓榭莎亭萝筱阴，依稀气象似山林。\n橘枝亚路黄苞重，井脉牵湖碧甃深。\n稚子遮门留熟客，惊蝉入座避游禽。\n四邻不见孤高处，翻笑腾腾只醉吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}